WEBVTT

01:30.630 --> 01:33.500
<b>"The World Isn't So Kind as to Allow One-Sided Attacks"</b>

01:33.540 --> 01:34.330
<b>Oh!</b>

01:34.330 --> 01:36.880
<b>Hey, I can see the city of Hanabusa!</b>

01:36.880 --> 01:39.000
<b>It looks just like a Japanese city!</b>

01:39.000 --> 01:43.330
<b>Takatou-kun, don't you
wanna hone your skills?</b>

01:43.330 --> 01:47.710
<b>There's no point,
I just kill enemies one after another.</b>

01:47.710 --> 01:48.540
<b>Huh?</b>

01:48.830 --> 01:52.080
<b>Demons and theives were coming after us.</b>

01:52.080 --> 01:55.880
<b>Let me know about those!
Carelessly walking around is pretty dumb!</b>

01:56.040 --> 01:58.250
<b>I'm very aware of that.</b>

01:58.830 --> 02:02.000
<b>But, if you get tired
after using your power...</b>

02:02.000 --> 02:05.790
<b>then maybe your power can only be used
a limited number of times or something.</b>

02:06.460 --> 02:10.130
<b>Getting tired lets me use it
as much as I want.</b>

02:10.130 --> 02:11.920
<b>There's seriously no limit?!</b>

02:19.000 --> 02:20.130
<b>Oh...</b>

02:20.130 --> 02:23.920
<b>Seems like instead of castle walls
they've put up a barrier.</b>

02:26.670 --> 02:29.630
<b>Whoa! A high-rise hotel!</b>

02:30.380 --> 02:33.210
<b>Celestina-san told me about it.</b>

02:33.210 --> 02:35.420
<b>This will be our base for a while.</b>

02:35.420 --> 02:36.880
<b>I'm down!</b>

02:42.750 --> 02:44.330
<b>This is swanky.</b>

02:45.580 --> 02:46.880
<b>I knew it!</b>

02:46.880 --> 02:48.380
<b>It's you, Dannoura-san!</b>

02:48.380 --> 02:49.330
<b>Huh?</b>

02:49.330 --> 02:52.040
<b>Wonderful, I'm so glad you're safe.</b>

02:52.040 --> 02:54.630
<b>Tachibana-kun? Why are you here?</b>

02:54.630 --> 02:57.460
<b>Everyone should still be
in that primeval forest.</b>

02:57.460 --> 03:00.250
<b>I move separately from them.</b>

03:00.460 --> 03:04.210
<b>There's no need for me to work with
those who level up inefficiently.</b>

03:04.210 --> 03:05.920
<b>Oh, really?</b>

03:05.920 --> 03:07.330
<b>Who is this woman?</b>

03:07.330 --> 03:09.540
<b>You're being awfully friendly with Yuuki!</b>

03:09.540 --> 03:10.250
<b>Huh?</b>

03:10.500 --> 03:12.130
<b>Lay off, Erika.</b>

03:12.130 --> 03:14.130
<b>These guys are my classmates.</b>

03:14.580 --> 03:16.750
<b>If you say so, Yuuki...</b>

03:16.750 --> 03:18.830
<b>Master, you are so noble!</b>

03:18.830 --> 03:21.960
<b>Your spirit is so tolerant,
even when dealing with rude people!</b>

03:21.960 --> 03:24.210
<b>Very befitting of a champion!</b>

03:24.210 --> 03:27.170
<b>Takatou-kun, who are these people?</b>

03:27.170 --> 03:29.040
<b>Your guess is as good as mine.</b>

03:29.040 --> 03:31.420
<b>Ah. I have yet to introduce you.</b>

03:31.630 --> 03:33.460
<b>These girls are my bodyguards,</b>

03:33.460 --> 03:35.830
<b>specially chosen
from among all of my servants.</b>

03:35.830 --> 03:38.630
<b>Ladies, introduce yourselves.</b>

03:38.880 --> 03:41.080
<b>I'm Erika, fifth rank.</b>

03:41.080 --> 03:43.960
<b>Honestly, I have no desire
to give my name,</b>

03:43.960 --> 03:46.830
<b>but I have no choice
since Yuuki told me to.</b>

03:46.830 --> 03:49.960
<b>My name is Stephanie, fourth rank.</b>

03:49.960 --> 03:54.080
<b>I don't want to talk to you unless
my master orders me to do so, though.</b>

03:54.080 --> 03:57.000
<b>Chelsey, third rank.</b>

03:57.540 --> 03:59.540
<b>Miss, will you die, please?</b>

03:59.540 --> 04:02.250
<b>I'm Euphemia, second rank.</b>

04:02.250 --> 04:04.790
<b>Frankly, I find you unsightly,</b>

04:04.790 --> 04:07.250
<b>so would you please disappear
from my sight?</b>

04:07.250 --> 04:11.080
<b>I am Riza, and I serve as
the captain of the bodyguards.</b>

04:11.460 --> 04:15.460
<b>Don't be so arrogant as
to think of him as "only a classmate."</b>

04:15.460 --> 04:19.250
<b>Would you quit smacking us
with the hostility already?!</b>

04:19.250 --> 04:20.750
<b>Oh, my apologies.</b>

04:20.750 --> 04:23.710
<b>I'm no good at being harsh with girls.</b>

04:23.710 --> 04:26.130
<b>All of you keep quiet for a bit.</b>

04:26.130 --> 04:27.540
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

04:27.880 --> 04:32.290
<b>Tachibana was one of the students
left behind with us, huh?</b>

04:32.290 --> 04:34.630
<b>I don't know what
kind of power he acquired,</b>

04:34.630 --> 04:36.250
<b>but he sure is confident in it.</b>

04:36.250 --> 04:40.710
<b>Uh, well... He's always been like this.</b>

04:40.710 --> 04:45.420
<b>He's been popular with girls for awhile,
and was always so cocky.</b>

04:45.880 --> 04:47.330
<b>High school was</b>

04:47.330 --> 04:50.880
<b>a much more interesting place
than I thought it would be.</b>

04:50.880 --> 04:52.000
<b>That's right!</b>

04:52.000 --> 04:54.290
<b>Meeting you here is some sort of destiny.</b>

04:54.750 --> 04:56.380
<b>Will you become my mistress?</b>

04:57.460 --> 04:58.380
<b>What?</b>

04:59.000 --> 05:02.880
<b>True, I am perhaps too hasty
in my asking you to be my mistress.</b>

05:02.880 --> 05:05.880
<b>Are you maybe concerned about Takatou?</b>

05:05.880 --> 05:08.040
<b>I don't usually accept men,</b>

05:08.040 --> 05:12.080
<b>but since he's a classmate,
I can take him in as a servant.</b>

05:12.250 --> 05:15.380
<b>It's come all the way back
to not being funny...</b>

05:15.380 --> 05:19.130
<b>I have no urge to kill him
when he lacks this much sense.</b>

05:19.130 --> 05:22.330
<b>What is it that makes you so confident?</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:29.500
<b>(Dominator)</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:29.500
<b>Can control lower-ranked</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:29.500
<b>opponents as slaves.</b>

05:23.710 --> 05:26.830
<b>I am a Dominator, the strongest class,</b>

05:26.830 --> 05:28.250
<b>and I control everything.</b>

05:28.250 --> 05:29.540
<b>That's why.</b>

05:29.540 --> 05:32.540
<b>I don't think I've seen you
look so smug before.</b>

05:33.000 --> 05:36.830
<b>But you still haven't had
much training, have you?</b>

05:36.830 --> 05:40.710
<b>All our classmates
are still training in the forest.</b>

05:40.710 --> 05:43.290
<b>You're just so taken by me
you can't help it!</b>

05:43.290 --> 05:44.080
<b>What?</b>

05:44.080 --> 05:45.080
<b>It's fine.</b>

05:45.080 --> 05:47.670
<b>I'll tell you a little something
about myself.</b>

05:47.880 --> 05:50.420
<b>First</b>

05:47.880 --> 05:50.420
<b>Mission</b>

05:47.880 --> 05:50.420
<b>Cleared</b>

05:48.460 --> 05:50.670
<b>It was a victory party
at the town I arrived in</b>

05:50.420 --> 05:53.080
<b>First Mission Cleared!</b>

05:50.670 --> 05:52.460
<b>after clearing my first mission.</b>

05:53.130 --> 05:56.130
<b>Hey, do you have a moment, Tachibana-kun?</b>

05:56.960 --> 05:59.330
<b>Ootori? What do you need?</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:01.830
<b>I'd like to give you a bit of advice.</b>

06:02.920 --> 06:05.000
<b>I'm a Consultant.</b>

06:05.000 --> 06:09.210
<b>(Consultant)</b>

06:05.000 --> 06:09.210
<b>Analyzes skills and gives</b>

06:05.000 --> 06:09.210
<b>counsel for problem resolution.</b>

06:05.420 --> 06:06.830
<b>My role is to give counsel</b>

06:06.830 --> 06:09.250
<b>in order to resolve any problems.</b>

06:09.250 --> 06:11.790
<b>Why are you giving me counsel?</b>

06:11.790 --> 06:16.460
<b>Since you're a Dominator,
everyone is avoiding you.</b>

06:16.670 --> 06:18.170
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

06:18.170 --> 06:20.920
<b>You don't have the time to squabble
amongst your peers right now.</b>

06:20.920 --> 06:25.580
<b>If no Sages arise from our classmates,
everyone will be made into livestock.</b>

06:27.630 --> 06:30.040
<b>What you should do first of all</b>

06:30.040 --> 06:34.330
<b>is purchase a large amount
of the weakest level-one servants.</b>

06:34.540 --> 06:36.790
<b>If the servants are victorious in battle,</b>

06:36.790 --> 06:38.830
<b>the defeated enemies
can become my servants,</b>

06:38.830 --> 06:41.210
<b>and their experience
becomes mine as well.</b>

06:42.080 --> 06:45.880
<b>But that sort of thing
wasn't in the explanation of my abilities.</b>

06:45.880 --> 06:50.540
<b>A Consultant's abilities also
includes knowing hidden specs.</b>

06:51.500 --> 06:54.250
<b>Why are you making an effort
to tell me this?</b>

06:55.540 --> 06:59.580
<b>We need various approaches
to bring forth a Sage.</b>

06:59.580 --> 07:02.460
<b>Everyone using the same methods
is suicidal behavior.</b>

07:02.750 --> 07:06.460
<b>Giving advice to those who seem to be
promising raises our chance of success.</b>

07:07.880 --> 07:10.170
<b>This is my survival strategy.</b>

07:10.580 --> 07:12.080
<b>I pray for your good fortune.</b>

07:15.130 --> 07:16.630
<b>And that's why.</b>

07:16.630 --> 07:20.130
<b>There is way too much
support personnel in this world!</b>

07:17.710 --> 07:20.080
<b>Concierge</b>

07:20.380 --> 07:21.630
<b>I get it.</b>

07:21.630 --> 07:25.460
<b>Even while you're building up
the number of subordinates like this,</b>

07:25.460 --> 07:27.830
<b>you're raising your level too, right?</b>

07:28.000 --> 07:31.670
<b>Correct. My level is increasing
by leaps and bounds!</b>

07:31.830 --> 07:34.540
<b>Whaddaya think, Dannoura-san?
Wanna rethink being-</b>

07:34.540 --> 07:36.130
<b>Nothing in me wants that!</b>

07:36.500 --> 07:39.580
<b>It doesn't have to happen now,
just think it over.</b>

07:40.000 --> 07:42.210
<b>Well, let's head out, everyone.</b>

07:42.210 --> 07:44.750
<b>I'm still a little pissed off.</b>

07:44.750 --> 07:47.580
<b>Well, we just have
to leave him be, I think...</b>

07:47.920 --> 07:53.080
<b>But if you join forces with him,
you may be safer than you are with me.</b>

07:54.250 --> 07:56.500
<b>You're gonna make me mad, Takatou-kun.</b>

07:56.500 --> 07:59.670
<b>Uh, I'm not sure why, but sorry.</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:21.210
<b>This is the Aggressor, The Darkness.</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:23.380
<b>Sage.</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:23.380
<b>Immortal vampire who possesses</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:23.380
<b>an astounding restoration ability.</b>

08:21.210 --> 08:23.420
<b>It doesn't stand a
single chance against me.</b>

08:26.920 --> 08:30.040
<b>How much longer can we stay here
like this, I wonder.</b>

08:30.670 --> 08:33.040
<b>Perhaps until the boy awakens.</b>

08:33.040 --> 08:35.040
<b>We're already on day three...</b>

08:35.040 --> 08:35.830
<b>Oh, I know!</b>

08:35.830 --> 08:38.250
<b>Mokomoko-san,
can you look in on him for us?</b>

08:38.250 --> 08:39.540
<b>I would rather not!</b>

08:39.540 --> 08:40.250
<b>Huh?</b>

08:40.250 --> 08:44.750
<b>There's no telling what will happen
if I enter that room without permission.</b>

08:45.000 --> 08:48.420
<b>Just training all the time is exhausting,
so I'm gonna get some air...</b>

08:48.750 --> 08:50.920
<b>Uh, what's that?</b>

08:58.130 --> 09:04.290
<b>Follower of Lain the Sage.</b>

08:58.130 --> 09:04.290
<b>Commands the Immortal Corps of the Undead Unit.</b>

08:59.330 --> 09:01.210
<b>This is an invitation
from the Immortal Corps!</b>

09:01.210 --> 09:02.710
<b>If you're run over and killed,</b>

09:02.710 --> 09:04.330
<b>you become a third-class zombie!</b>

09:04.330 --> 09:06.330
<b>You should volunteer!</b>

09:06.790 --> 09:07.460
<b>Huh?</b>

09:07.460 --> 09:10.880
<b>They're... not decent people.</b>

09:10.880 --> 09:13.170
<b>They're riddled with the stench of death.</b>

09:13.170 --> 09:16.250
<b>But, like, what is up with this world!
This is weird!</b>

09:16.250 --> 09:18.710
<b>People are dying far too easily!</b>

09:19.710 --> 09:23.460
<b>Well, didn't you say you wanted
to take a look outside?</b>

09:23.460 --> 09:25.460
<b>No thanks.</b>

09:25.460 --> 09:29.830
<b>Man, pretty rooms in a high-class hotel
sure are cozy!</b>

09:30.170 --> 09:34.960
<b>You can't possibly spend your time here
like this forever.</b>

09:34.960 --> 09:36.250
<b>And furthermore...</b>

09:36.250 --> 09:37.130
<b>Hm?</b>

09:37.130 --> 09:40.750
<b>There's someone secretly watching us here
with hostile intent,</b>

09:40.750 --> 09:42.380
<b>but I can't see them.</b>

09:42.380 --> 09:44.710
<b>What do we do if we can't see them?</b>

09:45.330 --> 09:46.210
<b>All right.</b>

09:46.210 --> 09:48.790
<b>I'll try to wake Takatou-kun
with a phone call.</b>

09:48.790 --> 09:52.250
<b>H-how refreshingly reliant of you...</b>

09:53.710 --> 09:54.960
<b>Yogiri-kun...</b>

09:55.630 --> 09:57.250
<b>Yogiri-kun!</b>

10:01.250 --> 10:03.040
<b>Morning, Nikori.</b>

10:04.750 --> 10:06.420
<b>You're already up, right?</b>

10:06.420 --> 10:08.210
<b>Breakfast is ready.</b>

10:08.500 --> 10:11.130
<b>Okay. I'm coming.</b>

10:21.920 --> 10:25.130
<b>All right. I'm on my way there.</b>

10:53.170 --> 10:54.380
<b>It's me.</b>

10:55.500 --> 10:57.080
<b>Get in here, quick!</b>

10:58.380 --> 11:00.210
<b>There was definitely something here.</b>

11:00.210 --> 11:01.080
<b>Huh?</b>

11:01.250 --> 11:03.790
<b>The hostility was aimed at you,
Dannoura-san.</b>

11:03.790 --> 11:05.710
<b>Why at me?</b>

11:07.170 --> 11:08.880
<b>I'm gonna use your phone.</b>

11:10.290 --> 11:11.290
<b>Hello?</b>

11:11.290 --> 11:14.170
<b>A woman collapsed
in the fifth floor hallway.</b>

11:14.420 --> 11:15.750
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

11:15.750 --> 11:18.080
<b>Wouldn't it be unnatural for me
not to notice a dead body</b>

11:18.080 --> 11:19.380
<b>while going down the hallway?</b>

11:19.670 --> 11:21.380
<b>But a dead body?</b>

11:23.830 --> 11:25.250
<b>Erika</b>

11:25.500 --> 11:27.540
<b>Erika's signal has disappeared?</b>

11:27.540 --> 11:28.920
<b>Master!</b>

11:31.880 --> 11:33.000
<b>Takatou-kun!</b>

11:33.000 --> 11:36.170
<b>This person has to be
one of Tachibana-kun's group.</b>

11:36.170 --> 11:38.080
<b>She's the bodyguard named Erika.</b>

11:38.080 --> 11:39.250
<b>This isn't good.</b>

11:39.250 --> 11:41.580
<b>Looks like there's gonna be
a fight with that guy.</b>

11:41.580 --> 11:43.380
<b>Maybe it's best we get out of here.</b>

11:43.380 --> 11:45.790
<b>Okay, I'm gonna hurry
and get my things together.</b>

11:46.290 --> 11:50.750
<b>Dannoura-san, you're pretty calm
for a situation like this.</b>

11:51.040 --> 11:54.960
<b>I'm pretty freaked out,
but I guess I'm used to it.</b>

11:54.960 --> 11:57.000
<b>Everyone must die someday.</b>

11:57.000 --> 11:59.420
<b>The daughter of a warrior family
wouldn't get upset</b>

11:59.420 --> 12:01.500
<b>over something so trivial as this!</b>

12:01.500 --> 12:03.670
<b>I'm not quite that
spiritually enlightened!</b>

12:12.250 --> 12:13.630
<b>What a let-down.</b>

12:15.420 --> 12:17.170
<b>Impressive as always, Master!</b>

12:17.170 --> 12:20.380
<b>Even level 100 demons
stand no chance against you!</b>

12:20.830 --> 12:23.080
<b>Who are you cretins?!</b>

12:23.080 --> 12:26.040
<b>Uh, Flare Bomb.</b>

12:30.000 --> 12:31.130
<b>Contract.</b>

12:32.170 --> 12:34.580
<b>M-Master...</b>

12:34.580 --> 12:35.540
<b>Heal!</b>

12:38.630 --> 12:40.790
<b>What floor do these ruins go to?</b>

12:41.380 --> 12:44.330
<b>It goes to floor 150.</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:47.630
<b>Get more allies as you progress down
to the lower layers.</b>

12:47.630 --> 12:49.790
<b>As you wish.</b>

12:52.960 --> 12:55.130
<b>So, what's happened to Erika?</b>

12:55.130 --> 12:57.420
<b>She should be on standby at the hotel.</b>

12:57.920 --> 12:59.000
<b>Erika</b>

12:58.080 --> 13:00.080
<b>I'll check the log.</b>

13:03.330 --> 13:04.920
<b>This makes no sense.</b>

13:04.920 --> 13:06.880
<b>She was attacked from behind?</b>

13:06.880 --> 13:11.330
<b>It's hard to imagine that Erika as an
assassin would be taken by surprise</b>

13:11.330 --> 13:14.420
<b>Why was Erika in the hallway
in the first place?</b>

13:14.420 --> 13:16.290
<b>If I may make a speculation...</b>

13:16.290 --> 13:17.630
<b>Go ahead.</b>

13:17.630 --> 13:22.250
<b>Maybe she was trying to please you
by bringing you that woman...</b>

13:22.250 --> 13:26.380
<b>or perhaps she was trying to get rid
of her as she thought her unworthy.</b>

13:26.380 --> 13:27.880
<b>Get rid of her?</b>

13:27.880 --> 13:30.540
<b>Aren't servants supposed to act in a way
as to not put their master</b>

13:30.540 --> 13:32.080
<b>at a disadvantage?</b>

13:32.080 --> 13:34.420
<b>It's possible that what we each thought</b>

13:34.420 --> 13:37.830
<b>was good for the other
didn't align with your wishes, Master.</b>

13:37.830 --> 13:42.380
<b>If Erika has done something extraneous,
Dannoura-san will have possibly escaped...</b>

13:42.380 --> 13:45.380
<b>I'll have Riza and Chelsey
go secure Dannoura-san.</b>

13:57.880 --> 14:00.500
<b>It's the same no matter
how many times I try it.</b>

14:00.500 --> 14:05.330
<b>My high-speed revival is much faster
than its crumbling upon being touched.</b>

14:05.880 --> 14:10.540
<b>Nevertheless, the Darkness doesn't
seem to be taking any damage at all.</b>

14:15.500 --> 14:16.670
<b>Oh my.</b>

14:16.670 --> 14:19.500
<b>Where are you going in such a hurry?</b>

14:23.210 --> 14:24.670
<b>What do you want?</b>

14:24.670 --> 14:26.290
<b>Something like this.</b>

14:29.080 --> 14:34.000
<b>Yuuki-kun told us to bring
Dannoura-san to him.</b>

14:34.000 --> 14:36.290
<b>If you come quietly we won't hurt y-</b>

14:37.500 --> 14:38.460
<b>Huh?</b>

14:38.830 --> 14:41.210
<b>Wow. This is pretty weak, huh?</b>

14:41.790 --> 14:43.420
<b>It's cold! And hard!</b>

14:43.420 --> 14:46.920
<b>I tried to kill the icicle.
Looks like I can do it.</b>

14:46.920 --> 14:49.130
<b>What do you mean "kill the icicle"?!</b>

14:50.580 --> 14:52.210
<b>Why didn't that work?!</b>

14:56.130 --> 14:57.710
<b>Wand, die.</b>

15:00.880 --> 15:04.830
<b>As you can see,
I can kill anything with just my thoughts.</b>

15:04.830 --> 15:06.920
<b>Try anything and I'll kill you.</b>

15:06.920 --> 15:10.420
<b>Now, will you answer
my questions honestly?</b>

15:10.420 --> 15:12.130
<b>Fine.</b>

15:12.290 --> 15:14.630
<b>Can you use magic
even without your wand?</b>

15:14.960 --> 15:17.000
<b>I am a Wandmaster.</b>

15:17.000 --> 15:19.830
<b>I can only use the magic in the wand.</b>

15:19.830 --> 15:21.500
<b>Since you're a wand user,</b>

15:21.500 --> 15:24.290
<b>that means you have
more than the one, right?</b>

15:24.290 --> 15:26.250
<b>This is the only other one I have.</b>

15:28.500 --> 15:30.960
<b>Why'd you bother hiding it there?!</b>

15:30.960 --> 15:33.750
<b>And, Takatou-kun,
you're staring pretty hard there!</b>

15:33.750 --> 15:37.210
<b>No, I just didn't know
it was something you could hide.</b>

15:37.580 --> 15:41.460
<b>You were ordered to take
Dannoura-san by Tachibana, right?</b>

15:41.460 --> 15:42.880
<b>What about the rest of your group?</b>

15:44.040 --> 15:47.830
<b>They were given the same order, of course.</b>

15:55.210 --> 15:56.630
<b>Dannoura-san?</b>

15:56.630 --> 16:00.920
<b>At long last, the gift of the Dannoura-way
has started to manifest!</b>

16:01.210 --> 16:03.330
<b>What is this?! A doll?</b>

16:04.630 --> 16:08.290
<b>I thought I'd be able to manage on my own.</b>

16:14.000 --> 16:16.670
<b>They move better
than I thought they would.</b>

16:16.670 --> 16:20.710
<b>Everyone, beat that woman
half to death.</b>

16:27.500 --> 16:28.460
<b>Huh?</b>

16:28.460 --> 16:32.000
<b>Oh no! Morurun! Jennifer! Jackie!</b>

16:32.000 --> 16:33.830
<b>Move! Please!</b>

16:36.250 --> 16:38.080
<b>Stop it! That's enough!</b>

16:38.080 --> 16:40.080
<b>Don't do anything mean!</b>

16:40.080 --> 16:44.960
<b>It's like we're becoming
some intensely bad people...
</b><b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b><b></b>

16:47.540 --> 16:50.290
<b>Master, what's happening?</b>

16:50.790 --> 16:52.170
<b>Riza's dead.</b>

16:52.170 --> 16:53.250
<b>No way!</b>

16:53.500 --> 16:57.460
<b>It seems Chelsey lost the will to fight
and gave them our intel.</b>

16:57.880 --> 17:00.830
<b>He says he can kill anything
with just a thought,</b>

17:00.830 --> 17:02.040
<b>but what do you make of that?</b>

17:02.040 --> 17:04.710
<b>It sounds highly implausible.</b>

17:04.960 --> 17:09.000
<b>I'll lead them to a place that's
easier to observe them while attacking.</b>

17:15.670 --> 17:19.630
<b>Can't you scream a little more cutely?</b>

17:19.630 --> 17:20.580
<b>Ah, cockro-</b>

17:20.580 --> 17:21.630
<b>Don't say it!</b>

17:21.630 --> 17:25.080
<b>I feel like just that word
will fill my brain with them!</b>

17:25.080 --> 17:30.170
<b>Tachibana has come to observe us
by using all the bugs under his control.</b>

17:30.170 --> 17:32.630
<b>Can you do something
about the cockatiels?!</b>

17:32.630 --> 17:35.130
<b>By cockatiel, you mean these things?</b>

17:35.130 --> 17:39.290
<b>I can kill them, but they'll just
plop down on our heads.</b>

17:40.080 --> 17:42.080
<b>Okay, scratch that idea!</b>

17:42.080 --> 17:46.330
<b>But even these things
may be able to kill a human.</b>

17:46.330 --> 17:50.580
<b>Whoa, whoa, whoa, it's not like they
can really kill people, right?!</b>

17:50.580 --> 17:54.460
<b>Maybe if a huge amount of them got into
your mouth they could suffocate you.</b>

18:01.380 --> 18:03.250
<b>Yuuki Tachibana...</b>

18:03.250 --> 18:06.500
<b>You have completely pissed me off!</b>

18:06.500 --> 18:07.710
<b>This is awful.</b>

18:07.710 --> 18:12.790
<b>At this rate, all living things in this
world will become our enemies...</b>

18:15.750 --> 18:19.380
<b>Hmph, your ability can't be used
if you're surrounded, eh?</b>

18:19.380 --> 18:22.170
<b>Maybe they'll give up if
they keep getting chased around.</b>

18:22.170 --> 18:23.420
<b>Master...</b>

18:23.420 --> 18:27.380
<b>There's no need to make an enemy
of a mysterious and unknown power.</b>

18:27.380 --> 18:30.130
<b>Why do I have to retreat?</b>

18:30.130 --> 18:33.330
<b>That wouldn't be the action
a Dominator should take, would it?</b>

18:35.040 --> 18:36.670
<b>Those who run around pathetically</b>

18:36.670 --> 18:39.040
<b>are the ones who have made
an enemy of a Dominator!</b>

18:39.040 --> 18:40.580
<b>Yogiri Takatou...</b>

18:40.580 --> 18:41.750
<b>Kill him!</b>

18:44.630 --> 18:47.920
<b>T..Takatou-kun, it's like the bugs are...</b>

18:47.920 --> 18:52.040
<b>It's like they're vigilantly watching for
a chance at us with an eagerness to kill.</b>

18:52.040 --> 18:55.500
<b>I'm sure we'll die with them
swarming us like this!</b>

18:55.500 --> 18:57.580
<b>I'll kill Yuuki Tachibana.</b>

18:57.580 --> 18:58.630
<b>Huh?</b>

18:58.630 --> 19:02.830
<b>If this goes how I think it will,
it won't be that hard to do.</b>

19:07.830 --> 19:10.790
<b>The source of this desire to kill...</b>

19:11.920 --> 19:13.420
<b>Got him.</b>

19:13.420 --> 19:14.880
<b>Yuuki Tachibana.</b>

19:15.290 --> 19:16.330
<b>Die.</b>

19:24.540 --> 19:25.290
<b>No!</b>

19:25.290 --> 19:27.380
<b>Was that an unexpected dud?!</b>

19:27.380 --> 19:30.000
<b>The cockatiels are still alive and well!</b>

19:30.000 --> 19:34.210
<b>We got here because my abilities work.</b>

19:34.210 --> 19:37.500
<b>It'll work even if you don't know
where the target is?!</b>

19:37.500 --> 19:41.830
<b>If he can reach us,
then we can reach him.</b>

19:42.080 --> 19:45.420
<b>This world isn't so kind
as to allow one-sided attacks.</b>

19:45.420 --> 19:48.460
<b>That's a line that only you could say!</b>

19:48.460 --> 19:51.420
<b>And these bugs seem
to be getting more active!</b>

19:52.460 --> 19:56.540
<b>I wonder if they were released
from his control since Tachibana is dead.</b>

19:56.540 --> 19:59.500
<b>Nope, nope, nope, that's not good!</b>

20:00.460 --> 20:01.290
<b>Let's run.</b>

20:01.290 --> 20:02.830
<b>You're not gonna kill 'em?</b>

20:02.830 --> 20:07.290
<b>Don't you think it's bad to kill something
just because it's unpleasant?</b>

20:07.290 --> 20:10.830
<b>Arguments about fairness are not what I
wanna hear in a situation like this!</b>

20:12.000 --> 20:15.290
<b>Heal! Heal! Heal! Heal!</b>

20:16.960 --> 20:18.330
<b>Master!</b>

20:18.330 --> 20:21.080
<b>We've been released from his control...</b>

20:21.420 --> 20:24.290
<b>I'm leaving, but what will you do?</b>

20:25.040 --> 20:26.500
<b>I, uh...</b>

20:27.040 --> 20:28.130
<b>Goodbye.</b>

20:32.790 --> 20:34.880
<b>Where is this light coming from?</b>

20:34.880 --> 20:36.420
<b>Something's off...</b>

20:41.580 --> 20:44.080
<b>What in the world is this?</b>

20:50.000 --> 20:52.750
<b>Oh? Where did you emerge from?</b>

20:52.750 --> 20:55.960
<b>I don't think you can survive an attack
from the Darkness...</b>

20:56.380 --> 20:59.290
<b>Nothing can be done about it
and I'm at a loss now.</b>

20:59.290 --> 21:01.500
<b>I'll hear what you have to say.</b>

21:06.580 --> 21:07.500
<b>Charm.</b>

21:16.170 --> 21:19.960
<b>I am Lain the Sage, an Origin Blood.</b>

21:19.960 --> 21:25.080
<b>Become my follower,
and tell me everything you know.</b>

21:28.880 --> 21:31.580
<b>We should probably head back
to the royal capital.</b>

21:33.210 --> 21:36.580
<b>What? I feel like this isn't over...</b>

21:42.210 --> 21:46.210
<b>Sorry this is coming outta nowhere,
but the zombie party's starting now!</b>

21:46.460 --> 21:51.380
<b>Zombie survivors,
have a good time with whoever you want!</b>

21:54.250 --> 21:55.080
<b>What?</b>

21:58.290 --> 22:00.920
<b>I thought this other world
would be a fantasy,</b>

22:00.920 --> 22:03.750
<b>but now we're in zombie panic mode!</b>

23:36.250 --> 23:40.380
<b>"The Fact That You're Watching This Video..."</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:39.670
<b>"The Fact That
You're Watching This Video..."</b>
